  "content": "# 第30题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★★☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n30. As for systems thinking, which would the author agree with?\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. It may be used to justify power imbalance.\n\nB. B. It can be applied to tackle challenges.\n\nC. C. It helps to prove why hunger exists.\n\nD. D. It goes beyond human imagination.\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nB\n\n",
  "answer": "A",
  "analysis": "本题考查情态动词表推测。must have done表示对过去情况的肯定推测。句意：他一定已经完成了工作。故选A。"
